            "rationale": "One shared fixed-Hz body impulse response, with broad lower and upper resonances. Convolution multiplies the reed spectrum, preserving absent odd bins. No additive harmonic filling. This is a compact design hypothesis, not a uniquely identified acoustic bore. Authored for 48 kHz.",
