        "version": 1,
        "description": "Compact reed/body saxophone study. CC2 pressure/closure width; CC1 tongue/breath attack; CC3 alternating closure. One five-point doubled reed and one common body response across all notes. Play the embedded register/pressure phrase. Development prototype: register realism, vibrato and fluid connected articulation remain to be refined.",
        "tags": [ "Brass" ],
